 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "About",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 5
   },
   "targets": [],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Lab 9: performance test** of the group **Lab 9 - Performance test**.\n\n* *Records/s* is the rate of the counter `lab9.records.out` (after `MergeRecord`) over 1 min; Prometheus scrapes every **15 s**, so a run must last at least ~1 min to show up well. The fixed workload of 2,000,000 records takes ~10 s: for a live view run the whole group (generator included) for a few minutes; for exact numbers use `make lab09-measure`.\n* *Invalid / failed* must stay 0: otherwise records are lost and the throughput is not comparable.\n* Queues, threads and CPU per processor come from NiFi status: CPU is a **rolling 5-minute window**."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Records/s (1 min)",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 5
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(rate(nifi_processor_counters{counter_name=\"lab9.records.out\"}[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "records/s"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "value",
    "graphMode": "area",
    "justifyMode": "auto",
    "orientation": "auto",
    "textMode": "auto"
   }
  },
